==== SCRIPT ====
exec 2>/dev/null; { kill -HUP $BASHPID; } & sleep 1; wait $!; echo "late $?"; { echo e1; exit 3; } & wait $!; echo "exit $?"
==== STDOUT ====
late 129
e1
exit 3

